Did the report writer consume working memory?\\n    - Does the report explain why this is a useful base demo?\\n    - Could a developer inspect the viewer and understand where the work happened?\\n</quality_bar>","tools_allowlist":["read_context","spawn_research_scouts","review_research_reports","spawn_followup_scouts","queue_report_writer"],"tools_disallowlist":[],"extensions":false,"domain_rules_installed":false,"variables_resolved":{"researchMemoryDir":"research-memory","phase":"research","userPrompt":"Research the next step for turning this simple kernel into a richer agent experience."}},"spanId":"a05d8016-7594-4c4b-becd-d69fc318d745","parentEventId":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-02T21:28:44.496Z"}",
